Responsible (R): Merchandising Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1–2 days/season</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2364_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2364_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
