        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-418 (ensure controlled execution — HQ-to-Store Communication &amp; Broadcast (PA-63.1).) | - Operational: VP Merchandising package sign-off; VP Store Operations readiness-check before season start
Owner: Merchandising Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
